# .gitignore for COGME Project

# OS and Editor Specific
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
**/.vscode/
**/Thumbs.db

# Build and Output
**/dist/
**/build/
**/tmp/
**/coverage/
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.zip

# SDD Internal Mechanics
**/sdd/intermediate/
**/sdd/cache/
**/sdd/credentials.json
**/sdd/audit_logs/

# Dependency Management
**/node_modules/
**/yarn.lock
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# IDE and Editor Config
**/.idea/
**/.project
**/.settings/
**/.classpath

# Security and Sensitive Data
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.cer
**/*.jks
**/*.truststore

# Temporary and Log Files
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp
**/*.bak

# Documentation Exclusions
**/docs/intermediate/
**/docs/legacy/

# COGME Specific Exclusions
**/agent-registry.yaml
**/dispatcher-config.yaml
**/sdd/secret-metrics.json

# Note: This .gitignore excludes SDD internal mechanics and sensitive artifacts per project governance. Public documentation remains in /docs and /README.md. Adjust based on your stack and add specific entries for any additional sensitive files.
# restaurado 2026-10-26 (VIO-012): pesos locais fora do repo
models/
*.gguf

# --- Higiene anti-bloat (pasta-raiz) — decisão CCB-LOG-2026-10-30-A01 ---
argparse
lst.txt
*.tmp.md
.~*.docx
.obsidian/
